From ec50ae0001acbe3203ec74f8043617acb9ae0409 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:06:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Two more technique rows, Weapon and Earth: twelve elements,
 sixteen techniques, an Offense buff, the Blade and Gaia cups

The fourth row reads NATURE and the earth row at the end takes the name it had. Techset scrolls twelve rows; the two
new rows draw one tile each from SYSTEM_W with two palettes. Save layout 3: an older save learns, once, the first
technique of each new row its partner's species has. The save load asks the resident learnMove and copies the
extension with memcpy, so the MENU overlay still ends before ENDI's first sector in nine languages.
